WEBVTT

00:00.680 --> 00:04.500
Execute him. By the letter of the law, he deserves death!

00:05.000 --> 00:12.000
Let those scholars at the Academy wail and protest all they like—what real tempest could they possibly stir?

00:12.500 --> 00:22.000
I execute Yu Gong, and then open up several dozen extra quotas in the imperial civil examinations—and those scholars will immediately quiet down.

00:22.500 --> 00:30.000
When all is said and done, the scholars of this realm crave official rank and wealth—not a dead Chancellor. My second son... you are still far too green.
